# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output.
#
# No figure is committed. Every chart in this project is produced by running the
# algorithms, so shipping images would only ever duplicate what two `make`
# targets rebuild:
#
#   make figures SEED=paper   the paper's Figures 3-8, into paper_figures/
#   make figures-nominal      the 20-seed Table 1 run, into figures/
#
# The measured CSVs under experiments/results/ *are* committed: they are small,
# text, diffable, and they are the evidence behind the numbers quoted in
# VERIFICATION.md. REPRODUCE.md section 7 states the policy per directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
benchmarks/results/
experiments/results/all_figures/
experiments/results/diagnostics/
experiments/results/paper_reproduction/
experiments/results/figures/
experiments/results/paper_figures/

# Rebuilt in seconds by `make analyze`.
experiments/analysis/results/

# The published PDF, kept locally for reference. Redistribution is the
# publisher's call, so it is not committed by default.
*.pdf
